        "html": "<body>\n\n\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Nossas Palestras — Hyper Island</title>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:ital,wght@0,700;0,800;1,700;1,800&amp;family=Montserrat:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,500;0,600;0,700;1,300;1,400&amp;display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n/* ===== CSS VARIABLES — LIGHT THEME (mesmo sistema do case Grupo Boticário) ===== */\n:root {\n  --hi-black: #F5F4F0;\n  --hi-white: #111110;\n  --hi-orange: #FF7300;\n  --hi-orange-light: #FF8C00;\n  --hi-gray: #ECEAE4;\n  --hi-gray-mid: #D4D1C8;\n  --hi-gray-light: #888580;\n  --hi-gray-pale: #444240;\n  --hi-accent: #2A2927;\n\n  --font-heading: 'Barlow Condensed', 'ABC Gravity', 'Oswald', sans-serif;\n  --font-body: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;\n\n  --spacing-xs: 0.5rem;\n  --spacing-sm: 1rem;\n  --spacing-md: 2rem;\n  --spacing-lg: 4rem;\n  --spacing-xl: 8rem;\n}\n\n*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n\nbody {\n  background: var(--hi-black);\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 16px;\n  line-height: 1.7;\n  -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n}\n\n@font-face {\n  font-family: 'ABC Gravity';\n  src: local('ABC Gravity');\n}\n\nh1, h2, h3, h4, .label {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n}\n\n/* ===== HERO ===== */\n.palestras-hero {\n  position: relative;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-image {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 0;\n}\n\n.hero-bg-image img {\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  opacity: 0.6;\n}\n\n.hero-overlay {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    to bottom,\n    transparent 0%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.2) 40%,\n    rgba(10,10,10,0.88) 75%,\n    #0A0A0A 100%\n  );\n  z-index: 1;\n}\n\n.hero-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  width: 100%;\n}\n\n.case-label {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.case-label::before {\n  content: '';\n  display: block;\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 1px;\n  background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: clamp(2.8rem, 6vw, 6rem);\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 1.0;\n  letter-spacing: -0.02em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  max-width: 900px;\n}\n\n.hero-title em {\n  font-style: italic;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.hero-meta {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  padding-top: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\n.hero-meta-item {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.25rem;\n}\n\n.meta-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);\n}\n\n.meta-value {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.1rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: #F5F4F0;\n}\n\n.scroll-indicator {\n  position: absolute;\n  right: var(--spacing-lg);\n  bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  z-index: 2;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.scroll-indicator span {\n  font-size: 0.6rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n  writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n  transform: rotate(180deg);\n}\n\n.scroll-line {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 60px;\n  background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--hi-orange), transparent);\n  animation: scrollPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes scrollPulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; transform: scaleY(0.7); }\n  50% { opacity: 1; transform: scaleY(1); }\n}\n\n/* ===== INTRO SECTION ===== */\n.intro-section {\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  max-width: 1200px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl);\n  align-items: start;\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar { position: sticky; top: var(--spacing-lg); }\n\n.intro-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 8rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.9;\n  color: transparent;\n  -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(255,115,0,0.25);\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.2em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n\n.intro-sidebar-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  font-size: 1.6rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n  color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n.intro-body p:first-child {\n  font-size: 1.4rem;\n  font-weight: 300;\n  line-height: 1.5;\n  color: var(--hi-accent);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-left: 3px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  padding-left: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.intro-body p {\n  font-size: 1rem;\n  font-weight: 400;\n  line-height: 1.8;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-pale);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n\n.skill-badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem; margin: var(--spacing-md) 0; }\n.skill-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  font-size: 0.65rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.75rem;\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n}\n.skill-badge.orange {\n  border-color: var(--hi-orange);\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n  background: rgba(255,115,0,0.06);\n}\n\n/* ===== STATS BAND ===== */\n.stats-band { background: var(--hi-orange); padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-lg); overflow: hidden; }\n.stats-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;\n  display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n.stat-item { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.25rem; }\n.stat-number {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 3.5vw, 3.6rem);\n  font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; color: #0A0A0A; text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.stat-desc { font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 600; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; color: rgba(10,10,10,0.65); }\n\n/* ===== SECTION HEADER (reused pattern) ===== */\n.section-block { padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg); max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }\n.section-header {\n  display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: var(--spacing-lg);\n  margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl); padding-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n}\n.section-tag-num {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem); font-weight: 700;\n  line-height: 0.85; color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  flex-shrink: 0; text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n.section-tag-num.active { -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--hi-orange); }\n.section-header-content { padding-top: 1rem; }\n.timeline-tag {\n  display: inline-block; font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.18em;\n  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hi-black); background: var(--hi-orange);\n  padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n.section-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.1; color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n.section-subtitle { font-size: 1rem; color: var(--hi-gray-pale); max-width: 640px; margin-top: 0.75rem; }\n\n/* ===== CASES GRID (accordion cards) ===== */\n.cases-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 1rem;\n}\n\n.case-card {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: box-shadow 0.25s ease, transform 0.25s ease;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.case-card:hover { box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); transform: translateY(-2px); }\n\n.case-card-head {\n  padding: var(--spacing-md);\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.case-event-tag {\n  font-size: 0.62rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n\n.case-card-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.25rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hi-white); line-height: 1.15;\n}\n\n.case-card-speaker {\n  font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n  text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em;\n}\n\n.case-card-toggle {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;\n  font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-gray-light); margin-top: 0.5rem;\n}\n\n.case-card-toggle .plus {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.2rem; color: var(--hi-orange);\n  transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n}\n\n.case-card.is-open .case-card-toggle .plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n\n.case-card-body {\n  max-height: 0;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  transition: max-height 0.35s ease, padding 0.35s ease;\n  padding: 0 var(--spacing-md);\n  background: var(--hi-gray);\n  border-top: 1px solid transparent;\n}\n\n.case-card.is-open .case-card-body {\n  max-height: 600px;\n  padding: var(--spacing-md);\n  border-top: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n}\n\n.case-card-body p {\n  font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.75; color: var(--hi-gray-pale); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n.case-card-body p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n/* ===== THEMES SECTION ===== */\n.themes-categories { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-lg); }\n.theme-category-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange); margin-bottom: 1rem; display: block;\n}\n.themes-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 0.75rem; }\n\n.theme-pill {\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  padding: 1rem 1.25rem;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  background: #fff;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease;\n}\n.theme-pill:hover { border-color: var(--hi-orange); }\n.theme-pill.is-open { border-color: var(--hi-orange); }\n\n.theme-pill-title {\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n.theme-pill-title .plus {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--hi-orange); flex-shrink: 0;\n  transition: transform 0.25s ease;\n}\n.theme-pill.is-open .theme-pill-title .plus { transform: rotate(45deg); }\n\n.theme-pill-desc {\n  max-height: 0; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.3s ease, margin 0.3s ease;\n  font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--hi-gray-pale); line-height: 1.7;\n}\n.theme-pill.is-open .theme-pill-desc { max-height: 220px; margin-top: 0.75rem; }\n\n/* ===== MASONRY GALLERY + LIGHTBOX ===== */\n.gallery-heading {\n  display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--spacing-md);\n  margin-bottom: 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n.gallery-heading-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n.gallery-heading-note {\n  font-size: 0.7rem; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--hi-gray-light);\n}\n\n.gallery-masonry {\n  columns: 4 220px;\n  column-gap: 8px;\n  margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-lg);\n}\n\n.gallery-masonry .g-item {\n  break-inside: avoid;\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  cursor: zoom-in;\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.gallery-masonry .g-item img {\n  width: 100%;\n  display: block;\n  transition: transform 0.5s ease, opacity 0.5s ease;\n}\n\n.gallery-masonry .g-item:hover img { transform: scale(1.07); opacity: 0.85; }\n\n.gallery-masonry .g-item::after {\n  content: '';\n  position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,10,10,0.6), transparent 45%);\n  opacity: 0;\n  transition: opacity 0.3s ease;\n}\n.gallery-masonry .g-item:hover::after { opacity: 1; }\n\n.gallery-masonry .g-item .g-zoom {\n  position: absolute; bottom: 0.75rem; right: 0.75rem;\n  width: 2.1rem; height: 2.1rem;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(245,244,240,0.7);\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  color: #F5F4F0; font-size: 1.1rem; font-family: var(--font-heading);\n  opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px);\n  transition: opacity 0.3s ease, transform 0.3s ease;\n}\n.gallery-masonry .g-item:hover .g-zoom { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n\n.gallery-masonry .g-item.tall img { aspect-ratio: 3/4; object-fit: cover; height: 100%; }\n.gallery-masonry .g-item.wide img { aspect-ratio: 16/10; object-fit: cover; height: 100%; }\n\n/* Lightbox */\n.lightbox-overlay {\n  position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 9999;\n  background: rgba(8,8,8,0.94);\n  display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;\n  padding: 2rem; cursor: zoom-out;\n}\n.lightbox-overlay.is-open { display: flex; }\n.lightbox-overlay img {\n  max-width: 92vw; max-height: 88vh; object-fit: contain;\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n}\n.lightbox-close {\n  position: absolute; top: var(--spacing-md); right: var(--spacing-lg);\n  color: #F5F4F0; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 0.75rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(245,244,240,0.4); padding: 0.5rem 1rem; cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n/* ===== SPEAKERS / FLIP CARDS ===== */\n.speakers-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n  gap: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.flip-card {\n  perspective: 1600px;\n  height: 420px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\n.flip-card-inner {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 100%; height: 100%;\n  transition: transform 0.6s cubic-bezier(.4,.2,.2,1);\n  transform-style: preserve-3d;\n}\n\n.flip-card.is-flipped .flip-card-inner { transform: rotateY(180deg); }\n\n@media (hover: hover) {\n  .flip-card:hover .flip-card-inner { transform: rotateY(180deg); }\n}\n\n.flip-card-face {\n  position: absolute; inset: 0;\n  backface-visibility: hidden;\n  -webkit-backface-visibility: hidden;\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.flip-card-front {\n  background: #0A0A0A;\n}\n\n.flip-card-front img {\n  width: 100%; height: 65%; object-fit: cover; display: block; opacity: 0.92;\n}\n\n.flip-card-front-info { padding: 1.25rem; }\n\n.flip-card-name {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 1.4rem; color: #F5F4F0; line-height: 1.05;\n}\n\n.flip-card-role {\n  font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange); margin-top: 0.4rem; line-height: 1.4;\n}\n\n.flip-card-hint {\n  position: absolute; bottom: 1rem; right: 1.25rem;\n  font-size: 0.6rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgba(245,244,240,0.4);\n}\n\n.flip-card-back {\n  background: #fff;\n  border: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid);\n  transform: rotateY(180deg);\n  padding: 1.5rem;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  overflow-y: auto;\n}\n\n.flip-card-back-name {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\n  font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--hi-white); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n}\n\n.flip-card-back p {\n  font-size: 0.8rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--hi-gray-pale); margin-bottom: 0.6rem;\n}\n.flip-card-back p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n\n/* ===== TESTIMONIAL-STYLE QUOTE ===== */\n.quote-block {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg);\n  background: #fff;\n  border-left: 4px solid var(--hi-orange);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.quote-block::before {\n  content: '\"'; position: absolute; top: -1rem; right: var(--spacing-md);\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 8rem; font-weight: 700;\n  color: var(--hi-orange); opacity: 0.1; line-height: 1;\n}\n.quote-text {\n  font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 300; font-style: italic; line-height: 1.6;\n  color: var(--hi-white); position: relative; z-index: 1;\n}\n\n/* ===== HIGHLIGHT BOX ===== */\n.highlight-box {\n  padding: var(--spacing-lg); background: #fff; position: relative;\n  box-shadow: 0 2px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n}\n.highlight-box::after {\n  content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 3px; background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n.highlight-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n.highlight-text {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.2vw, 1.7rem); font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.25; color: var(--hi-white);\n}\n\n/* ===== DIVIDER ===== */\n.section-divider { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 var(--spacing-lg); }\n.section-divider hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--hi-gray-mid); margin: 0; }\n\n/* ===== CLOSING SECTION ===== */\n.closing-section {\n  background: var(--hi-gray);\n  padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg);\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n.closing-section::before {\n  content: 'HYPER\\AISLAND';\n  position: absolute; bottom: -2rem; right: -1rem;\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 10rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: transparent; -webkit-text-stroke: 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);\n  white-space: pre; line-height: 0.9; pointer-events: none; user-select: none;\n}\n.closing-inner {\n  max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: var(--spacing-xl); align-items: center; position: relative; z-index: 1;\n}\n.closing-label {\n  font-size: 0.65rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.2em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-orange); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);\n}\n.closing-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.6rem); font-weight: 700;\n  text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 1.0; color: var(--hi-white); margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);\n}\n.closing-text { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.8; color: var(--hi-gray-pale); }\n.cta-block {\n  display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-md); padding: var(--spacing-lg); background: var(--hi-orange);\n}\n.cta-block-title {\n  font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--hi-black); line-height: 1.1;\n}\n.cta-block p { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(10,10,10,0.75); }\n.cta-button {\n  display: inline-block; background: #0A0A0A; color: #F5F4F0; font-family: var(--font-body);\n  font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.15em; text-transform: uppercase;\n  text-decoration: none; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; transition: background 0.2s; cursor: pointer;\n  border: none; align-self: flex-start;\n}\n.cta-button:hover { background: #333; }\n\n/* ===== FADE UP ANIMATION ===== */\n.fade-up { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(30px); transition: opacity 0.7s ease, transform 0.7s ease; }\n.fade-up.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n\n/* ===== RESPONSIVE ===== */\n@media (max-width: 900px) {\n  :root { --spacing-lg: 2rem; --spacing-xl: 4rem; }\n\n  .intro-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n  .intro-sidebar { position: static; }\n  .intro-number { font-size: 5rem; }\n\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n\n  .cases-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .speakers-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }\n  .themes-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .gallery-masonry { columns: 3 160px; }\n\n  .closing-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n\n  .section-header { flex-direction: column; gap: var(--spacing-sm); }\n  .section-tag-num { font-size: clamp(4rem, 15vw, 8rem); }\n\n  .hero-meta { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: var(--spacing-md); }\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 600px) {\n  .cases-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .speakers-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  .flip-card { height: 460px; }\n  .gallery-masonry { columns: 2 140px; }\n  .stats-inner { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }\n}\n</style>\n\n\n\n<!-- ==================== HERO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"palestras-hero\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg-image\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/TW2_0093_ZrtfAmVr_hezmJIlf.jpg?v=1784661080\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"hero-overlay\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"hero-content\">\n    <div class=\"case-label\">Conteúdo &amp; Palestras</div>\n    <h1 class=\"hero-title\">Ideias que <em>provocam</em><br>e movem plateias</h1>\n\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Formato</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Keynotes &amp; Palestras Corporativas</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Temas</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">IA, Liderança, Inovação, Futuro do Trabalho</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"hero-meta-item\">\n        <span class=\"meta-label\">Idiomas</span>\n        <span class=\"meta-value\">Inglês, Espanhol e Português</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"scroll-indicator\">\n    <div class=\"scroll-line\"></div>\n    <span>Scroll</span>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== INTRO ==================== -->\n<section class=\"intro-section fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"intro-sidebar\">\n    <div class=\"intro-number\">HI</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-label\">Sobre o formato</div>\n    <div class=\"intro-sidebar-title\">Conteúdo com<br>paixão. Provocação<br>com propósito.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"intro-body\">\n    <p>Um ótimo conteúdo, entregue com paixão, estimula o pensamento e a ação em toda a experiência de um evento — e é exatamente isso que buscamos em cada palestra.</p>\n    <p>A Hyper Island regularmente cria apresentações de keynote envolventes para eventos: já subimos ao palco do Festival Cannes Lions e de encontros como RIO2C, Agile Trends, ConAgile, Hacktown e Rio Innovation Week, além de desenvolvermos conteúdo exclusivo sob medida para convenções e eventos internos de clientes.</p>\n    <p>Cada palestra é cuidadosamente adaptada aos objetivos e ao público do evento. Nossos palestrantes transitam por uma ampla gama de indústrias e temas, trazendo casos de mercado atualizados, ferramentas práticas e provocações que desafiam o pensamento convencional — deixando o público empoderado, esclarecido e pronto para agir.</p>\n\n    <div class=\"skill-badges\">\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Inteligência Artificial</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Liderança</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge orange\">Inovação &amp; Criatividade</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Futuro do Trabalho</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Bem-estar &amp; Performance</span>\n      <span class=\"skill-badge\">Gestão de Mudança</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<!-- ==================== STATS ==================== -->\n<div class=\"stats-band fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"stats-inner\">\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">6</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Palestrantes especialistas</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">200+</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Eventos e convenções</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stat-item\">\n      <div class=\"stat-number\">4</div>\n      <div class=\"stat-desc\">Continentes de atuação</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- ==================== GALERIA DE FOTOS ==================== -->\n<div class=\"section-block\" style=\"padding-bottom: 0;\">\n  <div class=\"fade-up\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-heading\">\n      <div class=\"gallery-heading-title\">Registros de palco</div>\n      <div class=\"gallery-heading-note\">Clique em uma foto para ampliar</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"gallery-masonry\">\n      <div class=\"g-item tall\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/f4dbafff-5c34-448b-bd25-55460aaf793f.jpg?v=1784661005')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/f4dbafff-5c34-448b-bd25-55460aaf793f.jpg?v=1784661005\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_5444.jpg?v=1784661096')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_5444.jpg?v=1784661096\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item wide\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/3268217d-9e70-4ddb-9002-1cad3732ae3b.jpg?v=1784661005')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/3268217d-9e70-4ddb-9002-1cad3732ae3b.jpg?v=1784661005\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6605.jpg?v=1784661098')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6605.jpg?v=1784661098\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item tall\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/9a79dae3-ee1d-4a63-90a5-1b6a399a5277.jpg?v=1784661005')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/9a79dae3-ee1d-4a63-90a5-1b6a399a5277.jpg?v=1784661005\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6264.jpg?v=1784661098')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6264.jpg?v=1784661098\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-22_at_11.17.46.jpg?v=1784661005')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-22_at_11.17.46.jpg?v=1784661005\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item wide\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6363.jpg?v=1784661100')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6363.jpg?v=1784661100\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item tall\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/b3386619-0742-4d44-820e-c8f90bd3d77f.jpg?v=1784661005')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/b3386619-0742-4d44-820e-c8f90bd3d77f.jpg?v=1784661005\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6716.jpg?v=1784661100')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6716.jpg?v=1784661100\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6625.jpg?v=1784661100')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/IMG_6625.jpg?v=1784661100\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item wide\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-22_at_11.17.32.jpg?v=1784661005')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/WhatsApp_Image_2024-05-22_at_11.17.32.jpg?v=1784661005\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/824c425d-23b1-4863-9fb0-323ea6a43d17.jpg?v=1784661006')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/824c425d-23b1-4863-9fb0-323ea6a43d17.jpg?v=1784661006\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n      <div class=\"g-item tall\" onclick=\"openLightbox('https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/8a70c253-1d41-45fe-8f4e-ba6d6c60ad9d.png?v=1784661007')\">\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0634/7023/9966/files/8a70c253-1d41-45fe-8f4e-ba6d6c60ad9d.png?v=1784661007\" alt=\"Palestra Hyper Island\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"g-zoom\">+</span>\n</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== CASES DE PALESTRAS ==================== -->\n<section class=\"section-block fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <div class=\"section-tag-num active\">01</div>\n    <div class=\"section-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Onde já estivemos</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Alguns palcos que já<br>ocupamos</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Clique em cada card para ver os detalhes de cada apresentação — do Festival de Cannes a convenções de vendas.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"cases-grid\">\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">Claro</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Adaptabilidade: A Competência Estratégica</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Time Hyper Island</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Uma palestra dinâmica sobre adaptabilidade como competência essencial para líderes e equipes em cenários de mudança constante. Utilizando o framework KSMM, conectamos ciência, comportamento humano e estratégia de negócios.</p>\n        <p><strong>Temas:</strong> mindset adaptável, gestão de energia mental e física, meta-aprendizagem e resiliência em ambientes de alta mudança.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">Festival Cannes Lions 2023</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Hacking Creativity</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Benito Berretta</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Benito Berretta conduziu os participantes por uma abordagem meta para desenhar a mentalidade para a criatividade, conectando polaridades, entrelaçamento e o processo neural por trás do potencial criativo.</p>\n        <p>Na segunda parte, uma autoavaliação em formato diamante (divergir/convergir) apresentou as 6 virtudes da Criatividade, formando um kit prático para maximizar o potencial criativo de cada participante.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">RIO2C 2024</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Inovação Consciente</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Tim Lucas</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>No maior encontro de criatividade da América Latina, Tim Lucas conduziu uma conversa sobre inteligência antropológica, a habilidade de formular problemas na era da IA e o reconhecimento de problemas invisíveis.</p>\n        <p>A sessão explorou a diferença entre pensamento consciente e inconsciente e o papel do design como ferramenta para moldar o futuro de forma ética e sustentável.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">World Creativity Day</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Hacking Creativity — Workshop</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Veronica Magariños</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Um workshop prático que ofereceu ferramentas e metodologias para impulsionar processos criativos, destacando seis virtudes essenciais: Curiosidade, Comunidade, Coragem, Compromisso, Concentração e Arte.</p>\n        <p>Os participantes conheceram os Creative Thinking Practice Cards, com conselhos práticos e recursos para cultivar cada uma dessas virtudes no dia a dia.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">Agile Trends 2024</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Learning Agility</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Benito Berretta</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>No maior evento ágil do Brasil, a palestra explorou mitos e equívocos sobre aprendizagem moderna, mergulhando nas taxonomias de Bloom e Kirkpatrick e conectando-as à Hyper Aprendizagem.</p>\n        <p>Destaque para os três princípios fundamentais de Learning Agility: vitalício, intencional e meta — e a capacidade de aprender com a experiência e aplicá-la em novas situações.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">ConAgile 2023 — Edição 5</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Learning Agility em 3 Princípios</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Benito Berretta</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Entre mais de 40 palestrantes do 5º Congresso Nacional de Agilidade, Benito abordou o que significa aprender — familiaridade, conhecimento, aplicação e multiplicação — e os princípios da aprendizagem ágil.</p>\n        <p>A sessão conectou esses conceitos ao lifelong learning e à importância de tornar a aprendizagem ágil intencional.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">CM Summit 2023</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Redes do Futuro</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Tim Lucas</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>No maior evento online sobre marketing de comunidades da América Latina, Tim Lucas trouxe um conteúdo sobre \"Redes do Futuro\", abrangendo economia comportamental, inteligência artificial, redes de pensamento e design thinking.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">InovaBra Habitat 2023</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Inclusive Innovation</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Tim Lucas</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Uma conversa sobre como olhar além dos pontos cegos individuais e organizacionais para impulsionar a inovação inclusiva e disruptiva, com cases inspiradores e dados recentes do mercado.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">InovaBra Habitat 2023</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Saúde Mental no Ambiente Corporativo</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Veronica Magariños</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Um bate-papo sobre ferramentas e técnicas para promover o bem-estar mental, discutindo como criar ambientes de trabalho mais inclusivos e de apoio.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">EvoluTI — 6ª edição 2023</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Meta Habilidades (Meta Skills)</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Tim Lucas</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>No maior evento de desenvolvimento pessoal para profissionais de tecnologia, Tim Lucas apresentou as meta skills — as habilidades por trás das habilidades — essenciais para construir, inovar e aprender a aprender.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">V360</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Agile Innovation</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Benito Berretta</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Uma extensão dinâmica do evento anual da V360 para clientes e potenciais clientes: os participantes exploraram como \"hacks\" comportamentais e de mentalidade tornam equipes mais dinâmicas e colaborativas.</p>\n        <p>A atividade \"Agile Mash-Up\" complementou a palestra com um sprint de Design Thinking sobre colaboração, inclusão e foco no cliente.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">Braskem</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">Empreendedorismo na Complexidade</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Time Hyper Island</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Uma palestra de 90 minutos para cerca de 400 participantes, usando o Modelo Iceberg, a ferramenta \"Menos e Mais\" e a Gestão de Polaridades para explorar os desafios de fazer mais com menos em um cenário de multipluralidade e globalização.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"case-card\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n      <div class=\"case-card-head\">\n        <span class=\"case-event-tag\">JCDecaux — Convenção de Vendas 2024</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-title\">IA na Prática para o Time de Vendas</div>\n        <span class=\"case-card-speaker\">Time Hyper Island</span>\n        <div class=\"case-card-toggle\">\n<span>Ver detalhes</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"case-card-body\">\n        <p>Para cerca de 140 pessoas, o desafio era desmistificar a Inteligência Artificial com conteúdo inspirador e mão na massa. A sessão permitiu que o time experimentasse IA interagindo com seus pares, aplicando o conceito ao dia a dia de vendas.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== TEMAS ==================== -->\n<section class=\"section-block fade-up\">\n  <div class=\"section-header\">\n    <div class=\"section-tag-num\">02</div>\n    <div class=\"section-header-content\">\n      <div class=\"timeline-tag\">Menu de temas</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">Temas que também<br>podemos levar ao seu evento</h2>\n      <p class=\"section-subtitle\">Clique em cada tema para saber mais. Toda palestra é adaptada aos objetivos e ao público do seu evento.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"themes-categories\">\n\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"theme-category-label\">Inteligência Artificial</span>\n      <div class=\"themes-row\">\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Inteligência Artificial e Ética</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Como garantir que a IA seja desenvolvida e usada de forma ética e responsável.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Inteligência Artificial para Humanos</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Como usar IA para melhorar nossa experiência humana no dia a dia e no trabalho.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>IA como Alavanca de Performance</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Como usar a Inteligência Artificial para potencializar a performance individual e de times.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">I will be Data: Tecnologia Emergente e os Humanos de Amanhã<span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Uma imersão na antropologia do futuro: como a IA e as tecnologias emergentes redefinem a ética, as relações sociais e a experiência do cliente.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"theme-category-label\">Liderança &amp; Gestão de Mudança</span>\n      <div class=\"themes-row\">\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Liderança Adaptativa</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Estratégias para liderar equipes em ambientes de mudança rápida e constante.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Gestão de Mudanças</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Como liderar e gerenciar mudanças organizacionais de maneira eficaz, minimizando a resistência.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Resolução de Conflitos</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Estratégias para lidar com conflitos de forma construtiva e promover um ambiente de trabalho harmonioso.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Gestão de Talentos e Retenção</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Estratégias para recrutar, desenvolver e reter talentos em um mercado competitivo.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"theme-category-label\">Inovação &amp; Criatividade</span>\n      <div class=\"themes-row\">\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Inovação Disruptiva</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Como as empresas podem abraçar a inovação disruptiva para se manterem competitivas em um mercado em constante evolução.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>The Death of Design Thinking</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Uma palestra que questiona a relevância futura do design centrado no humano e explora filosofias de design centradas na vida e no planeta.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Accessible Innovation</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Como o design inclusivo se torna estratégia central de negócio e catalisador de novos modelos e expansão de mercado.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">From Storytelling to Storybuilding<span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Da narrativa tradicional à construção interativa de histórias — como engajar fandoms e microcomunidades através da cocriação.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"theme-category-label\">Futuro do Trabalho &amp; Bem-estar</span>\n      <div class=\"themes-row\">\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Future Skills</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">As mudanças profundas no mercado de trabalho e o desenvolvimento de meta skills — adaptabilidade, pensamento crítico e inteligência emocional — que distinguem os trabalhadores humanos em um mundo automatizado.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">Play in the Future: Mentalidade de Futuro<span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">O poder transformador de um mindset de futuro, com ferramentas práticas de tendências e design especulativo para fomentar criatividade e colaboração.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Bem-estar e Performance</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Estratégias para promover o equilíbrio entre as polaridades de bem-estar e performance.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Diversidade e Inclusão</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">A importância da diversidade e inclusão no local de trabalho e como promovê-las efetivamente.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Future Ethics: Tecnologia para o Bem</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Estruturas e ferramentas para avaliar as implicações éticas da inovação, transformando a ética em vantagem estratégica.</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"theme-pill\" onclick=\"this.classList.toggle('is-open')\">\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-title\">\n<span>Economia Digital e Tecnologia</span><span class=\"plus\">+</span>\n</div>\n          <div class=\"theme-pill-desc\">Explorando as oportunidades e desafios da economia digital e da tecnologia para os negócios.</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"highlight-box\" style=\"margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);\">\n    <div class=\"highlight-label\">Além da palestra</div>\n    <div class=\"highlight-text\">Também curamos conteúdo para antes e depois do evento — introduções acessíveis ou Kits de Aprendizado completos para apoiar a aplicação prática das habilidades pelos participantes.</div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"section-divider\"><hr></div>\n\n<!-- ==================== GALERIA DE FOTOS 2 ==================== -->\n<div class=\"section-block\" style=\"padding-top: var(--spacing-lg); padding-bottom: 0;\">\n  <div class=\"fade-up\">\n    <div class=\"gallery-heading\">\n      <div class=\"gallery-heading-title\">Mais bastidores e apresentações</div>\n      <div class=\"gallery-heading-note\">Clique em uma foto para ampliar</div>\n    </div>\n    <d